--------------------------------------------------------------------------
ART AND AUDIO ARE NOT COVERED BY THIS LICENSE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This license covers the source code, the JSON content tables, and the
documentation in this repository. It does not cover, and this repository does
not redistribute, the art and audio the game loads.

Those assets come from the Humble "Complete RPG Creator Bundle" and are
licensed separately by their individual creators. They live outside version
control in assets-raw/, which is gitignored and rebuilt from the purchased
archives by cmd/assetpipe. docs/ASSET-INVENTORY.md is a catalogue of what the
bundle contains, not a copy of it.

The screenshots in docs/screenshots/ necessarily show that art in use. They are
included for documentation only.

To run the game with its intended art you need your own copy of the bundle.
Without it the game still runs: every unresolved asset falls back to a
procedurally generated placeholder.
